<title>USA: Steel Technologies Q2 March 31 net falls.</title>
<headline>Steel Technologies Q2 March 31 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net			  1,736		    3,366</p>
<p> Revs			79,799		   76,630</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,963		   11,958</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.46</p>
<p> Net			  4,200		    5,477</p>
<p> Revs		     157,829		  142,338</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,958		   11,999</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Steel Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Q2 results hurt in part by outages at Ghent pickling facility due to flood conditions in early March.</p>
<p>Acquisition of Atlantic Coil Processing Inc, completed April 1, expected to be accretive to earnings in second half.</p>
